{
  "$comment": "Prospective raw configuration schema only. BOUND_CONFIGURED is not PREFLIGHT_VALIDATED or approval. The seven logical backends keep their existing owner/capability/namespace policy; two labels never establish independent administration. Exact typed authority/configuration sidecars are pre-effect inputs.",
